Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.71,0:00:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}新的一天早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是一個夾雜著期待與不安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感覺還有點小鹿亂撞的 新的一天的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要出發咯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐 今天幾點回來？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要準備晚餐哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.65,0:00:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}說不定會晚一點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為有 社團活動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}從今天開始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我就是火箭研究社的部長了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Bonavuu！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}噢~今天比之前更加元氣滿滿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}正因為我是部長嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真期待放學之後呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.85,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}又是她倆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那兩個額頭少女啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你倆天天用碰額頭來打招呼的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.78,0:02:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讓我感到很羞恥 不許再做了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你是說「額門感應」？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}誰知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遙乃 還有你也要注意點
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬 你要不也來試試「額門感應」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那東西難道不奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}試著在腦海中想像你喜歡的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.17,0:02:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喜歡的事物？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就這樣貼在你的額門上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雖然我不知道瞬在想什麼喜歡的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.11,0:02:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是 如果讓幽來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.47,0:02:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我知道啦 我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就如同心有靈犀一般地知曉了一切
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是這種 很厲害的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.81,0:03:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}絕對什麼也不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我怎麼會和這種騙人的丸子天線頭交朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}誰是騙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可是正宗外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是是是 好人設
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊啦？老師的會議差不多就要結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.19,0:03:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要來了嗎 最終結果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算了 那麼嘔心瀝血寫的申請書
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}100%會通過的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}終於要來了 社團活動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.99,0:03:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}同？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.99,0:03:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}會？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.05,0:03:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起 孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}老師已經盡力了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.24,0:03:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是社團活動是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼叫「社團活動成績不足」啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.02,0:03:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說過絕對可以的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然後資金呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}0
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}活動室呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}放學後的空教室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}指導老師呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}解散吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我已經盡我全能了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.08,0:03:55.31,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}別那樣說嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}畢竟拿不到錢 就沒有意義啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且老師你教的科目
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:03:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是體育吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.87,0:04:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是現代文啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}和火箭完全沒關係啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…我覺得還行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}同…同好會
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}「社團活動成績」什麼的…今後去做就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}說不定就可以被認定為社團了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.41,0:04:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想 想和大家一起試試看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎…怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也有一定道理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算了 既然會長大人發話了 也就沒什麼好說的了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}會…？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你從部長晉升了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.01,0:04:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果會長
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好啊 孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家一起以晉級社團為目標而努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}為了這麼努力的你們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}老師準備了小禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼 好吃的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.83,0:04:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鐺鐺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}禮輕情意重嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你這禮也太輕了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.53,0:04:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雖然我已經是老師了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.87,0:04:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但我還是要還大學時候的助學貸款
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:04:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}很辛苦的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是瞬弄哭她的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是我不好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是 就算可以接受同好會
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}活動室要怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為要造東西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以必須找一個廠房
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我的家可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的假的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的假的！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這不是秘密基地嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.19,0:05:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是秘密基地哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.07,0:05:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼樣 瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嚇了一大跳嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}誰 誰知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遙乃也不介意了 我們就用這個燈塔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}為什麼是遙乃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}本來是我的祖父在管理這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在已經廢棄了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在這裡誰也不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以嘛 我覺得沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你可真是大膽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說這裡已經廢棄了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這不是還通著電嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你不會是在偷電吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其實呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}祖父從這裡離開之後
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}應該是斷了所有的電的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自從幽來了之後
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不知道怎麼的就又通上電了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這就是外星人的力量啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊哈噗哈哈噗哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.99,0:06:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是有發電機嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.39,0:06:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}過一會去機房調查一下吧
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.43,0:06:18.54,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家 拿杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}為我們同好會的誕生乾杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}外星也有這種文化嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Vui！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果會長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來說幾句吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是新官上任呢 海果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好好發揮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我會…努力做好會長的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣我就能幫助明內你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家正在興頭上 再喝再喝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再來點小吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來一點就好…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.73,0:06:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哎呀 手抖了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:07:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果的話 一定可以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}成為大家的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最近 姐姐經常用家裡的電腦調查東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個電腦小白姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸 這個是雷門同學的火箭？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}上了高中之後
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就感覺變了個人一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}穗波 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我想要列印這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但它怎麼變成PFD了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像也沒變啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天又是經典的瞬的風格呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}天丸閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}「天丸」？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}天線丸子頭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}的縮寫就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.71,0:07:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}天丸！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你臉上的傷是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.85,0:07:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只是被老爸扔過來的扳手不小心碰了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}「扳手」？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}「只是」？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}難道是你為了比賽 偷你老爸的發動機的火藥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被你老爸發現了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嘿嘿 瞬應該是被狠狠訓了一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒被訓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只是吵了一架
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我本來以為是玩具槍的火藥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.19,0:08:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且我自己也挺小心的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就覺得沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.32,0:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算了 反正已經解決了 沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真 真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.07,0:08:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我用C型鉗子把我的老爸鉗回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}安全意識在哪裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}總之
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}開始做吧 火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}用安全的工具和正確的知識來做的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}誰做都可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯 你們也行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.11,0:08:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}安全的工具？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在這
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}正確的知識呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}肯定是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這次是老爸同意的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了 海果
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.86,0:09:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}終於要開始做火藥火箭了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太過高興…所以說不出…話來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.39,0:09:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}做之前就這副德行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天要讓你們每人製作一發火箭並發射
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}火箭模型？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就和我在比賽中用的那個一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是用火藥來發射的迷你火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.51,0:09:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也有官方的世界大賽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其實很想買一套部件來著…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厲害 有很多種火箭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}甚 甚至還帶降落傘…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}誰讓我們只有3000日元的資金呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瓶制火箭的推進力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來自於噴水給到的反作用力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而這個也是差不多一樣的道理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}發動機在燃燒的時候會向下噴出氣體
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在反作用之下火箭就會飛起來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這就是你說的發動機？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比想像的還要普通
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但這個可是能飛100公尺以上的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:09:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要是有更強力的發動機的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.33,0:10:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還能輕而易舉地飛這個的十倍往上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}十…十倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}模型火箭的發動機
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.09,0:10:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}根據總推力積的多少
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}用英文字母排序
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.05,0:10:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這次我們用的是最小型的A型
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸 A的後面還跟有數字…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看這個型號的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就能明白這個發動機的持續時間和發動時間
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遙乃 算一算從點火到降落傘打開之前需要多少時間
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}2.5除以8再加3…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}3.3125秒吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是吧 很簡單吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一點也不簡單吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}借我腦子用用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Mupipi
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}額頭作戰成功！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}腦子要壞掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.41,0:10:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}牛是力的單位…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}記錄記錄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要是想在火箭裡搭載降落傘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就要防止火藥燃燒的熱量將其熔化
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}輕輕地放進去 不能把它壓扁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最後再吹氣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真外行啊 給我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要用嘴把整個入口都蓋住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.49,0:11:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 還是你自己來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最後是發動機的設置
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}為了能用電點著火
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.15,0:11:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就得讓點火器接觸發動機的火藥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}火藥…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}用力不對的話 會爆炸的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爆…爆…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.87,0:11:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是要是有一點沒做好的話 就會變成啞火的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要好好連接上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好…好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的是靠我們自己做出來的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.63,0:11:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當然的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊…好累…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}腦袋裡已經一堆漿糊了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.73,0:12:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}畢竟才是第1次做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}後面再抽幾次空 詳細教你們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.95,0:12:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天 嗯…講的是有點太超綱了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.43,0:12:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.53,0:12:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不會的 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這下大家就可以一起造模型火箭了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天真的謝謝你 雷門同學
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬的話題感覺好無聊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對吧 感覺跟個男孩子一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸…但我還是想要那堆亂糟糟的數字
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬再借我一下額頭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算術練習冊我倒是可以借你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我應該已經 學會了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.11,0:12:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可 可以的話 讓我來教…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.52,0:13:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我的記性可不是很好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一次可不太夠哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.75,0:13:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看這邊 海果會長有重要的發表
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以說別在別人面前做這種事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下 下個月 有 有一個模型火箭的活動
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.62,0:13:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.31,0:13:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我在電腦上看雷門同學的火箭 就找到了這個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}作 作為同好會 大家一起去怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.75,0:13:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}贊成贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 學校那天也是週末
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.11,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？也有大型模型火箭的發射示範
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今 今天也學了很多 可以鞏固一下學的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.24,0:13:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}發射 發射！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}模型火箭的大發射！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}與其唱這麼傻的歌 還不如練練發射的口號
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}發射準備 完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒有低空飛行物體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}開始倒數計時
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}5 4 3 2…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}由於天氣不良 發射中止
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你要留下來過夜嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}號 號碼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}1
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}2
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}3
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}4
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}5！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}藤野岬高中火箭研究同好會
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出發！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}以為是來遠足的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就像慶典一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人還真是意外的多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}畢竟是和美食節同時舉辦的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來享受美食的客人也很多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嘛 在主菜的發射示範之前打發一下時間也行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}笑原老師 有什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我好像有幾個熟人也來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那我們就自己在這邊逛一逛就好了 老師請隨意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:15:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃…這不行 監護人怎麼能在遠足途中自己跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.16,0:15:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這不是遠足 你就隨意來吧 而且你也不是監護人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那我們要去哪裡逛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉 有撞到哪裡嗎 有沒有受傷
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.17,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對對對 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}給我們塑膠瓶的人
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.06,0:15:19.77,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找塑膠瓶的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.31,0:15:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找塑膠瓶的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們的熟人？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是之前為塑膠瓶火箭比賽找材料時遇到的人
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.71,0:15:27.32,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒想到居然還能再遇到你們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們也來這裡了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}唔嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好久不見 謝謝你之前的幫助
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}得好好說謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.02,0:15:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你 果然剛才還是撞到哪裡了 有哪裡不舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.08,0:15:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}之前不是見過一次嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們也是高中生嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.31,0:15:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的 是藤野岬高中的高一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}藤野高中啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我叫秋月彗 是立岡技術高中的高二
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.76,0:15:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}高二生！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}前輩？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 啊啊 之前友所布周請請多瓜照
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這傢伙很有趣吧 不用在意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小之星同學 明內同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.94,0:16:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}寶木同學 雷門同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再次 請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.91,0:16:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們是為什麼來參加這個活動呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當然是為了火箭大發射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}和我一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是在發射示範之前想買點給同伴的小吃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就逛了一下小吃攤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}結果就找不到怎麼回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在什麼都還沒買之前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.57,0:16:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}迷路了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}和我好像
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以的話 在找到你朋友之前 我們就一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們也會幫忙找的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.47,0:16:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的嗎 謝謝 幫忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這裡居然有這麼多有名的俱樂部的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不愧是火箭節
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 看這裡有好多火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.37,0:16:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個不是已經停產了的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.55,0:17:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以拍照嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感覺和瞬會很合得來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.72,0:17:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才不是那麼幼稚的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那可是前輩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個火箭的尾翼有兩個？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個應該是多段式的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}把火藥按豎向疊接在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}使用完後依次脫離 就可以飛得更高
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷 雷門同學真厲害 知道得好詳細
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哼 這種程度只是常識了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}吶吶  小之果同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這邊的火箭也可以看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個和剛才的不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.99,0:17:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是將好幾個引擎結合在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在一次飛行中可以製造出巨大的動力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 真的欸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算是同種類的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要改變引擎的排列方式和點火方式
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就能讓火箭呈現出不同的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}請給我一根烤玉米！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}烤玉米嗎 也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}給大家帶的點心就選它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}麻煩也給我三個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個…啊嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}錢包也忘記帶了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我 我借你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這傢伙到底是來幹嘛的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}給 久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}彗醬
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}前輩 該走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能會合真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}彗 一會再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在火箭大發射那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 在火箭大發射那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天的首要節目
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大型模型火箭的發射示範
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在正式開始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}老師我來拍照片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:31.76,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天的火箭發射示範的是由去年模型火箭錦標賽的優勝校
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}剛才拿到的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.14,0:18:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}由立岡技術高中的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}宇宙開發研究部的同學進行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下來是代表發言時間
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.46,0:18:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有請高二年級的秋月彗同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.29,0:18:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天能被邀請參加如此隆重的活動
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我十分感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是如方才所介紹的社團部長秋月彗
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.09,0:18:55.60,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊…彗同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在去年的大賽上能獲得優勝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}作為一名部員我感到十分榮幸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}希望今天的發射示範能夠滿足大家的期望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厲害啊 啪咻地~咻啪地飛起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感覺連宇宙都能去到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}吶 吶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.17,0:19:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也很激動
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}彗同學
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.66,0:19:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}彗 好厲害 真的好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:19:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還好成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒想到彗同學居然是代表
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.66,0:20:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是驚喜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊嘞 宣傳海報上沒寫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哦 對了 還錢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃嗯…放哪去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.19,0:20:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}剛才在台上的真的是彗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 有了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.01,0:20:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天不還也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們也會參加
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今年的模型火箭錦標賽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以 下次在賽場上你們輸掉的時候再還吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.98,0:20:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我的錢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.01,0:20:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個主意不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.49,0:20:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也還想和你們再見面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}三個玉米棒一共九百圓
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.96,0:20:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就先給我記個帳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好好記住哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不然我可能會忘掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能看到火箭真是不錯呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}照片有拍得好的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.89,0:20:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 明內嘴巴張得大大的照片倒是有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們也要參加今年的大賽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}老師會為你們應援的 加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也…我們也能做到那樣帥氣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}做得到 那是當然
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為有我在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一起加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}錢 我墊著先還你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是這些地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}特別守規矩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.31,0:23:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}老師 這個照片裡的是什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.53,0:23:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是火箭發射活動的時候的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.19,0:23:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看 這裡不是拍得有火箭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯…？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.87,0:23:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒有其他的照片嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.79,0:23:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃 有是有 但這張照片是照得最清楚的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.15,0:23:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就這張？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.07,0:23:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個 我倒是拍得有影片
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果要看的話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哇啊 快給我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.89,0:23:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 老師拍的明內同學的照片的話…
